msgstr "Exporter le package de pages/le package de sites"

msgid "这里只导出启灵主题自己的模块装修页。系统页和没有模块数据的普通页面不会出现在导出列表里；选择整站包时，可以额外写入设计系统、内容模型、菜单和站点基础信息。"
msgstr ""
"Only the Qiling theme's own module decoration page is exported here. System pages and ordinary "
"pageswithout module data will not appear in the export list; when selecting the entire site package,"
"you can additionally write the design system, content model, menu and site basic information."

